msgstr "Sivunvaihto"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:65
msgid "The default behavior of _wxMaxima_ when text is entered is to automatically create a math cell. Cells of other types can be created using the Cell menu, using the hot keys shown in the menu or using the drop-down list in the toolbar. Once the non-math cell is created, whatever is typed into the file is interpreted as text."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../../info/wxmaxima.md:67
